  <li><a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/dungeon-clawler/id6752933732">Dungeon Clawler+</a></li><br/>
  <li><a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/creatures-of-the-deep/id6756007771">Creatures of the Deep+</a></li><br/>
  <li><a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/pocket-city-2/id6748041195">Pocket City 2+</a></li><br/>
  <li><a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/draw-it/id6759712869">Draw It+</a></li><br/>
</ul>More details about these games were outlined <a href="https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2026/06/mini-football-legends-family-feud-pocket-and-seven-more-hits-join-apple-arcade/">in Apple's press release</a> earlier this month.<br/>
